<title>italy: CYCLING-PETITO WINS TIRRENO ADRIATICO.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-PETITO WINS TIRRENO ADRIATICO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN BENEDETTO DEL TRONTO, Italy 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Roberto Petito won the Tirreno-Adriatico cycling race on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Mario Traversoni, also Italian, won the 159-km seventh and final stage.</p>
</text>
